flowchart TD
    A([Dataset Loading<br/><i>UCI & Hannousse-Yahiouche</i>]) --> B([Data Preprocessing])
    B --> C([Stratified 80/20 Train-Test Split<br/><i>random state = 42; test set remains untouched</i>])
    C -->|training set only| D

    subgraph D [Imbalance Treatment Techniques]
        direction LR
        T1([Random Oversampling])
        T2([Random Undersampling])
        T3([SMOTE])
        T4([ADASYN])
        T5([SMOTEENN])
        T6([SMOTETomek])
        T7([Cost-Sensitive Learning])
    end

    D -->|select imbalance technique| E([Classifier Selection<br/><i>Decision Tree, Random Forest, Support Vector Machine</i>])
    E --> F([Model Training & Hyperparameter Optimisation<br/><i>stratified 5-fold cross-validation</i>])
    F --> G([Evaluation on Test Set<br/><i>Precision, Recall, F1-score, ROC-AUC, PR-AUC, MCC</i>])
    G --> H([Comparative Performance Analysis])
    H --> I([Statistical Significance Testing<br/><i>McNemar's Test, p &lt; 0.05</i>])

    F -.->|Repeat for each Dataset x Imbalance Technique x Classifier| D
